Column name: event_value_in_usd Type: FLOAT64 Description: A record containing the event parameter's value.
Column name: event_bundle_sequence_id Type: INT64 Description: If the event parameter is represented by a string, such as a URL or campaign name, it is populated in this field.
Column name: event_server_timestamp_offset Type: INT64 Description: If the event parameter is represented by an integer, it is populated in this field.
Column name: user_id Type: STRING Description: If the event parameter is represented by a floating point value, it is populated in this field. This field is not currently in use.
Column name: user_pseudo_id Type: STRING Description: If the event parameter is represented by a double value, it is populated in this field.
Column name: privacy_info Type: STRUCT<analytics_storage INT64, ads_storage INT64, uses_transient_token STRING> Description: The time (in microseconds, UTC) when the event was previously logged on the client.
Column name: user_properties Type: ARRAY<STRUCT<key INT64, value STRUCT<string_value INT64, int_value INT64, float_value INT64, double_value INT64, set_timestamp_micros INT64>>> Description: The currency-converted value (in USD) of the event's "value" parameter.
Column name: user_first_touch_timestamp Type: INT64 Description: The sequential ID of the bundle in which these events were uploaded.
Column name: user_ltv Type: STRUCT<revenue FLOAT64, currency STRING> Description: Timestamp offset between collection time and upload time in micros.
